### 상품 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "monitor",
  "price": 250000,
  "stock": 5
}

### 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/9104

### 없는 상품 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/9999

### 상품 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/9102
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "mouse-pro",
  "price": 18000,
  "stock": 15
}

### 빈 이름으로 등록 (400 예상)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "price": 1000,
  "stock": 1
}

### 음수 가격으로 등록 (400 예상)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "speaker",
  "price": -500,
  "stock": 1
}